5362322\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A lodge stay is only half the adventure. The other half? Mapping out trails through the Alpine wilderness!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design trails that match your guests’ skills and preferences!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade difficult segments, add camp points, and avoid dangers – unless your guests are ready for them!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guide trails to peaks, ski slopes, monuments, and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perform rescue missions, transport goods, and more with the <strong>Trail Task system</strong>!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use realistic land and air vehicles inspired by actual Alpine tech!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And whatever you do – don’t let anyone find <strong>Francis's bag</strong> (he hid it very well)!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2423760/extras/493719f20b11773ad4424b638d17f465.avif?t=1785362322\" width=620 height=72 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2423760/extras/a88b5d4561a57f6cea8edf21d198a0b7.poster.avif?t=1785362322\" width=620 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2423760/extras/a88b5d4561a57f6cea8edf21d198a0b7.webm?t=1785362322\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2423760/extras/a88b5d4561a57f6cea8edf21d198a0b7.mp4?t=1785362322\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story’s not your thing? Try <strong>Endless Winter Mode</strong> – play as long as you like without worrying about the plot. The crew’s still there, just a bit less stressed!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Remember to pack up enough snacks, and see you on the trail!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2423760/extras/172980b07680bcf5cd22edafbbf4ca34.poster.avif?t=1785362322\" width=1084 height=737 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2423760/extras/172980b07680bcf5cd22edafbbf4ca34.webm?t=1785362322\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Join the shelter crew and create the best Alpine resort in this cozy narrative tycoon! Enjoy rich character stories, attract and rescue alpinists, manage your resort, and forge new trails. Grab your map, pour a warm cup of tea, and brace for the harshest winter of the 1960s!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, German, Spanish - Spain, Polish, French, Traditional Chinese, Japanese, Portuguese - Brazil, Simplified Chinese, Russian, Ukrainian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“Above The Snow succeeds in a complex operation: combining the aesthetic satisfaction of a furniture simulator with the constant tension of a management survival game.”<br>7.8/10 – Passione video giochi<br><br>“This simulation game stands out for its tone, depth of systems, and unusual scenario. It shows how demanding mountain shelter management is when every decision counts.”<br>82/100 – Noob Feed<br><br>“Aside from that, I had a lot of fun with Above the Snow and can definitely recommend this strategic trip to the Alps.”<br>88/100 – Gaming At<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2423760/4499772f65f00